gin="44.823" end="45.161">M</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">恶灵退散 洲际导弹</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">akuryo taisan ICBM</span></p><p begin="45.355" end="48.010" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.355" end="45.670">環</span><span begin="45.670" end="46.018">状</span><span begin="46.018" end="46.441">線</span><span begin="46.441" end="46.831">を</span><span begin="46.831" end="47.056">走</span><span begin="47.056" end="47.257">り</span><span begin="47.257" end="47.437">抜</span><span begin="47.437" end="47.635">け</span><span begin="47.635" end="48.010">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">奔驰穿过环状线</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kanjyou sen wo hashiri nuke te</span></p><p begin="48.435" end="51.085" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.435" end="48.735">東</span><span begin="48.735" end="49.059">奔</span><span begin="49.059" end="49.507">西</span><span begin="49.507" end="50.005">走</span><span begin="50.005" end="50.237">な</span><span begin="50.237" end="50.432">ん</span><span begin="50.432" end="50.581">の</span><span begin="50.581" end="50.747">そ</span><span begin="50.747" end="51.085">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">东奔西走不算什么</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">touhonseisou na n no so no</span></p><p begin="51.535" end="54.365" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.535" end="51.832">少</span><span begin="51.832" end="52.294">年</span><span begin="52.294" end="52.657">少</span><span begin="52.657" end="53.059">女</span><span begin="53.059" end="53.329">戦</span><span begin="53.329" end="53.530">国</span><span begin="53.530" end="53.830">無</span><span begin="53.830" end="54.365">双</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">少年少女战国无双</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">syounen syoujyo sengoku musou</span></p><p begin="54.304" end="56.971" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.304" end="54.493">浮</span><span begin="54.493" end="54.837">世</span><span begin="54.837" end="55.437">の</span><