" end="1:07.422">断</span><span begin="1:07.422" end="1:07.793">頭</span><span begin="1:07.793" end="1:08.185">台</span><span begin="1:08.185" end="1:08.626">で</span><span begin="1:08.626" end="1:08.871">見</span><span begin="1:08.871" end="1:09.050">下</span><span begin="1:09.050" end="1:09.207">ろ</span><span begin="1:09.207" end="1:09.389">し</span><span begin="1:09.389" end="1:09.596">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在那断头台下俯视众生吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">so no dantou dai de mioroshi te</span></p><p begin="1:09.888" end="1:12.675" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.888" end="1:10.176">三</span><span begin="1:10.176" end="1:10.491">千</span><span begin="1:10.491" end="1:10.794">世</span><span begin="1:10.794" end="1:11.379">界</span><span begin="1:11.613" end="1:11.829">常</span><span begin="1:11.829" end="1:12.165">世</span><span begin="1:12.165" end="1:12.381">之</span><span begin="1:12.381" end="1:12.675">闇</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">三千世界黄泉之暗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sanzen sekaii tokoyo no yami</span></p><p begin="1:12.980" end="1:15.910" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:12.980" end="1:13.316">嘆</span><span begin="1:13.316" end="1:13.562">ク</span><span begin="1:13.562" end="1:14.048">唄</span><span begin="1:14.048" end="1:14.486">モ</span><span begin="1:14.711" end="1:14.936">聞</span><span begin="1:14.936" end="1:15.113">コ</span><span begin="1:15.113" end="1:15.296">エ</span><span begin="1:15.296" end="1:15.467">ナ</span><span begin="1:15.467" end="1:15.611">イ</span><span begin="1:15.611" end="1:15.910">ヨ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">连那哀叹之歌也听也无法听见啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nageku uta mo kikoe na i yo</span></p><p begin="1:16.055" end="1:18.975" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.055" end="1:16.410">青</span><span begin="1:16.410" end="1:16.662">藍</span><span begin="1:16.662" end="1:16.914">の</span><span begin="1:16.914" end="1:17.532">空</span><span begin="1:17.799" end="1:18.192">遥</span><span begin="1:18.192" end="1:18.393">か</span><span begin="1:18.393" end="1:18.708">彼</span><span begin="1:18.708" end="1:18.975">方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在那青蓝天空的遥远彼端</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">seiran no sora haruka kanata</span></p><p begin="1:19.205" end="1:22.733" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:19.205" end="1:19.371">そ</span><span begin="1:19.371" end="1:19.560">の</span><span begin="1:19.560" end="1:19.923">光</span><span begin="1:19.923" end="1:20.256">線</span><span begin="1:20.256" end="1:20.643">銃</span><span begin="1:20.643" end="1:21.096">で</span><span begin="1:21.096" end="1:21.291">打</span><span begin="1:21.291" end="1:21.480">ち</span><span begin="1:21.480" end="1:21.668">抜</span><span begin="1:21.668" end="1:21.840">い</span><span begin="1:21.840" end="1:22.733">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">就用那光线枪射穿吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">so no kousen jyuu de uchi nuite</span></p><p begin="1:35.253" end="1:38.196" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:35.253" end="1:35.613">百</span><span begin="1:35.613" end="1:36.049">戦</span><span begin="1:36.049" end="1:36.331">錬</span><span begin="1:36.331" end="1:36.549">磨</span><span begin="1:36.549" end="1:36.786">の</span><span begin="1:36.786" end="1:37.074">見</span><span begin="1:37.074" end="1:37.284">た</span><span begin="1:37.284" end="1:37.524">目</span><span begin="1:37.524" end="1:37.713">は</span><span begin="1:37.713" end="1:37.899">将</span><span begin="1:37.899" end="1:38.196">校</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">看来身经百战实为将校</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hyakusen renma no mitame wa syoukou</span></p><p begin="1:38.293" end="1:41.140" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:38.293" end="1:38.554">い</span><span begin="1:38.554" end="1:38.761">っ</span><span begin="1:38.761" end="1:38.935">た</span><span begin="1:38.935" end="1:39.091">り</span><span begin="1:39.091" e