u uta mo kikoe na i yo</span></p><p begin="2:18.516" end="2:21.441" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:18.516" end="2:18.762">希</span><span begin="2:18.762" end="2:18.915">望</span><span begin="2:18.915" end="2:19.194">の</span><span begin="2:19.194" end="2:20.049">丘</span><span begin="2:20.220" end="2:20.595">遥</span><span begin="2:20.595" end="2:20.781">か</span><span begin="2:20.781" end="2:21.111">彼</span><span begin="2:21.111" end="2:21.441">方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在那希望之丘的遥远彼端</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kibou no oka haruka kanata</span></p><p begin="2:21.605" end="2:25.061" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:21.605" end="2:21.755">そ</span><span begin="2:21.755" end="2:21.929">の</span><span begin="2:21.929" end="2:22.307">閃</span><span begin="2:22.307" end="2:22.673">光</span><span begin="2:22.673" end="2:23.085">弾</span><span begin="2:23.085" end="2:23.453">を</span><span begin="2:23.453" end="2:23.649">打</span><span begin="2:23.649" end="2:23.837">ち</span><span begin="2:23.837" end="2:24.065">上</span><span begin="2:24.065" end="2:24.261">げ</span><span begin="2:24.261" end="2:25.061">ろ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">就将那闪光弹射向天际吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">so no senkou dan wo uchi age ro</span></p><p begin="2:56.238" end="2:58.847" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:56.238" end="2:56.526">環</span><span begin="2:56.526" end="2:56.915">状</span><span begin="2:56.915" end="2:57.212">線</span><span begin="2:57.212" end="2:57.678">を</span><span begin="2:57.678" end="2:57.902">走</span><span begin="2:57.902" end="2:58.086">り</span><span begin="2:58.086" end="2:58.304">抜</span><span begin="2:58.304" end="2:58.482">け</span><span begin="2:58.482" end="2:58.847">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">奔驰穿过环状线</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kanjyou sen wo hashiri nuke te</span></p><p begin="2:59.300" end="3:01.955" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:59.300" end="2:59.582">東</span><span begin="2:59.582" end="2:59.939">奔</span><span begin="2:59.939" end="3:00.374">西</span><span begin="3:00.374" end="3:00.803">走</span><span begin="3:00.803" end="3:01.043">な</span><span begin="3:01.043" end="3:01.232">ん</span><span begin="3:01.232" end="3:01.373">の</span><span begin="3:01.373" end="3:01.550">そ</span><span begin="3:01.550" end="3:01.955">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">东奔西走不算什么</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">touhonseisou nan no so no</span></p><p begin="3:02.426" end="3:04.922" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:02.426" end="3:02.721">少</span><span begin="3:02.721" end="3:03.086">年</span><span begin="3:03.086" end="3:03.515">少</span><span begin="3:03.515" end="3:03.878">女</span><span begin="3:03.878" end="3:04.098">戦</span><span begin="3:04.098" end="3:04.298">国</span><span begin="3:04.298" end="3:04.665">無</span><span begin="3:04.665" end="3:04.922">双</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">少年少女战国无双</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">syounen syoujyo sengoku musou</span></p><p begin="3:05.154" end="3:07.838" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:05.154" end="3:05.486">浮</span><span begin="3:05.486" end="3:05.726">世</span><span begin="3:05.726" end="3:06.116">の</span><span begin="3:06.116" end="3:07.028">随</span><span begin="3:07.028" end="3:07.838">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">随波逐流漂在那浮世浪潮之中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ukiyo no manimani</span></p><p begin="3:08.286" end="3:11.169" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:08.286" end="3:08.522">千</span><span begin="3:08.522" end="3:08.922">本</span><span begin="3:08.922" end="3:09.834">桜</span><span begin="3:10.010" end="3:10.224">夜</span><span begin="3:10.224" end="3:10.500">ニ</span><span begin="3:10.500" end="3:10.898">紛</span><span begin="3:10.898" end="3:11.169">レ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">千本樱融入夜中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">senbon zakura yoru ni magir